OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is being done to stop        
OL,4,Adisruptive cable theft?                
OL,6,FIt is understood thieves lifted two    
OL,7,Fseparate concrete telecoms covers, cut 
OL,8,Fthe cables at either end, then winched 
OL,9,Fthem out with machinery.               
